{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226937","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226937","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422693701:1":{"text":"この苗木から、流光の樹と同じ力を感じます！","source_cn":"这棵树苗，我感觉到了！这是与流荧树同根同源的力量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B7F4CC023A6FA47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422693702:1":{"text":"この木の導きがあれば、サロクディアの地脈は少しずつ、ミサタ様の元へ戻っていくでしょう……","source_cn":"在它的引导下，整个萨洛克兰的地脉都开始逐渐归于弥萨忒的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5943B3A8C9068F0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422693703:1":{"text":"この流光の樹から、この地に住む方々への愛と慈しみを感じます。","source_cn":"而此处的人们，我已经能感到这棵流荧树的亲昵与钟爱了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34A8FD1FC511FFC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1422693703":{"text":"この流光の樹から、この地に住む方々への愛と慈しみを感じます。","source_cn":"而此处的人们，我已经能感到这棵流荧树的亲昵与钟爱了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34A8FD1FC511FFC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422693704:1":{"text":"はい、成功です。今、長らく枯れ果てていた土地を、ミサタ様の優しさが潤しています。","source_cn":"是的，弥萨忒正在用祂的温柔滋润这片干涸已久的土地，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BE729FA582B23CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docu