":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422693711:1":{"text":"私はサロクディアで生まれたエクシルで、地上の生活に、身勝手な幻想を抱いていた。","source_cn":"我是在萨洛克兰出生的艾塞勒，对地表上的生活充满着自以为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DFB1C273756BE83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422693712:1":{"text":"そして、その幻想は、間違いなく、彼らの想いを踏みにじるものだったんだ。","source_cn":"而这份幻想，也确实侮辱了他们的情感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AC05696C818BB01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422693713:1":{"text":"ナザレス、エイン、タドールに賢者タサル、さらに多くの、世を去った先人たちの――","source_cn":"奈萨雷斯，奎茵，都铎，已经去世的塔萨贤者，以及更多古老...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x504BB480694CAC28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422693714:1":{"text":"悲痛、憎しみ、屈辱、悔しさ、恐怖……","source_cn":"悲痛的，憎恨的，屈辱的，冤屈的，恐慌的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x438D8AE72B7099E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422693715:1":{"text":"だが同時に、それは何よりも確かで、愛おしい……故郷への想いだったんだろう。","source_cn":"……但却又无比确切，无比怀念的……思乡之情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE15F016643940AF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1